        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>2、为新疆人民打出一个民主联合政府</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    min-height: 720px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #24304a;\n    color: #cfd6e4;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .banner-top {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 95px;\n  }\n  .banner-bottom {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 100px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 22px 26px 30px 26px;\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n  h2.heading {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 34px 0;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.95;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  p.para:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  .underlined {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline;\n  }\n  .redline-block {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .redline {\n    position: absolute;\n    height: 3px;\n    background: #e8262b;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .redline.l1 {\n    left: -8px;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 30px;\n  }\n  .redline.l2 {\n    left: -10px;\n    width: 250px;\n    top: 66px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder banner-top\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Decorative pattern band: top, full width]</figure>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <h2 class=\"heading\">2、为新疆人民打出--个民主联合政府</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">受到长期迫害的新疆各族人民奋勇反抗，发动了伊犁、塔城、阿山三区人民革命。革命军队很快占领了以上三个地区，成立了临时革命政府。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">三区人民革命让盛世才感受到了各族人民抗争的力量，最终在革命力量和国民政府的双重压力下败走新疆。1945年日本投降以后，国民政府在全国各族人民的多方压力下，与临时革命政府开启谈判，假借谈判的手段分化瓦解革命力量。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"para redline-block\">恐怕谈判桌上的所有人都不会想到，赛福鼎以后会成为新中国的副able[?]级领导人。<span class=\"redline l1\"></span><span class=\"redline l2\"></span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder banner-bottom\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Decorative pattern band: bottom, full width]</figure>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
